Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 9,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamedai, por favor!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu adoro os mamedai daqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:46.79,0:00:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,E-eu também acho que você é uma pessoa adorável!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei que seria legal se pudéssemos estar na mesma turma!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,E... eu também...
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.94,0:00:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também te amo!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.31,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não, eu não quis dizer isso!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:58.20,0:00:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Quis dizer o seu mamedaifuku!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:00.47,0:01:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,M-M-Mamedaifuku?
Dialogue: 9,0:01:03.38,0:01:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim! Mamedaifuku!
Dialogue: 9,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Erros e mal-entendidos.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.41,0:01:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando a flor do amor desabrocha, sempre é meio embaraçoso.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é tão divertido quanto constrangedor.
Dialogue: 9,0:01:17.89,0:02:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{OP}
