Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:23.57,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Em um rompante de corrida antes que você perceba
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:26.74,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k26}{\k17}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ma{\k9}ru {\k23}de {\k33}don{\k19}na {\k38}par{\k34}ty {\k116}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:26.74,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quase como se cada festa acontecesse
