Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.35,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs45\blur0.9\fnMarker SD\c&H101411&\b1\pos(602.858,244.38)}Outubro \N10º é \NMochi \NDia{\b0}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.38,Top,,0,0,0,,Esses feijões são realmente bons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:52.52,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs12\blur0.6\fnMarker SD\c&H101411&\b0\pos(414.191,250.38)}Outubro \N10º é \NMochi \NDia{\b1}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:52.97,0:02:54.34,Top,,0,0,0,,Ei, pai...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.64,Top,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 9,0:02:55.64,0:03:00.86,Top,,0,0,0,,Mamedaifuku são bons, mas já que é outono, podemos tentar fazer daifuku de uva em vez disso?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.28,Top,,0,0,0,,Ou talvez daifuku de pera ou de caqui?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.06,Top,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:05.06,0:03:06.95,Top,,0,0,0,,Nossos daifuku são feitos com feijão.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:08.27,0:03:12.42,Top,,0,0,0,,Mas daifuku de morango são super populares!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:12.42,0:03:15.58,Top,,0,0,0,,Você tá negando a sua própria família?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:15.58,0:03:16.34,Top,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.34,0:03:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamedai!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.18,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuku!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:19.67,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, tá bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:26.59,0:03:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Você conhece essa música?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Só porque você a canta o tempo todo.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, tá.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.67,0:03:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, você já descobriu que música é essa?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ainda não.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:40.68,0:03:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu me pergunto qual é...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.22,0:03:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.06,0:03:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fica quieta.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.35,0:03:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pai?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.55,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.32,0:04:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Estava pensando em quais mamedaifuku ficam melhores.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.45,0:04:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma amiga vai comprar alguns hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:08.14,0:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai ser um presente, então pode separar alguns que fiquem bonitos?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro. Quantos?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:15.05,0:04:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco numa caixa por dez.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Qual o nome?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:19.89,0:04:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yuzuki-kun.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:25.74,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako, preparei o café da manhã.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:28.93,0:04:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Choi-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:41.61,0:04:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,O sol começa a se pôr
