Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.93,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(639,282)}Episódio
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.93,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(640,482)}Cantando uma canção de amor
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.93,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord0\blur1\3c&HB398EC&\pos(640,482)}Cantando uma canção de amor
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.63,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,na sala de música...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:51.23,0:04:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso está uma delícia!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.79,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,É ótimo ter a Choi-chan por perto!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,É bom ter um café da manhã tão chique assim.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos usando faca e garfo!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que estamos num país estrangeiro!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-sama, posso participar também?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Você estava comendo feijões antes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vai fazer chá para todo mundo primeiro.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.86,0:05:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:09.56,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pai, sobre o Dia do Mochi...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.12,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que não fazemos um evento de bater mochi, já que é o Dia do Mochi?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é como se fosse Ano Novo ou algo assim...
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,O estabelecimento do Mochizou está distribuindo produtos do personagem.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.94,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Personagem?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,É um presente para clientes que gastarem mais de 1000 ienes.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:25.84,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um chaveiro de celular do mochi mochi bouzu!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.24,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Que diabos é isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu prefiro fazer o mochi-pounding.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vamos bater mochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:33.58,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:34.14,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é só um teru teru bouzu?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Mochi-pounding?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece divertido.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.01,0:05:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Venham experimentar!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:43.77,0:05:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não posso tentar bater?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sou especialista em martelar pregos, então acho que eu seria bom nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:49.24,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Então você provavelmente seria ótimo nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, vocês dois!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.78,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós deveríamos estar praticando!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam exemplo para os calouros!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.32,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A Mido-chan é tão rígida.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me chamem de capitão!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Capitão!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,O poder muda as pessoas...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:08.84,0:06:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Que pena que você não virou capitão.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:12.06,0:06:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretendo usurpar o trono antes de nos formarmos.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Tem um dia pra isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:18.90,0:06:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando é?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,O Dia do Mochi é 10 de outubro.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:22.86,0:06:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,E é meu aniversário também, sabia.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.02,0:06:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.30,0:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Já lembrei!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.37,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que tivemos a mesma conversa no ano passado.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Então até amanhã, pessoal!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:34.12,0:06:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,É.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:40.94,0:06:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocchi...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:42.67,0:06:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, a Tamako te perguntou alguma coisa recentemente?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.32,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.44,0:06:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tipo o que me dar de presente no meu aniversário ou algo assim?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela esqueceu disso.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo o que ela tem na cabeça é o Dia do Mochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,E-eu entendo...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que eu devia esperar por isso...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Afinal, é o Dia do Mochi...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.53,0:07:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é uma droga!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá tudo bem, eu não estou tão chateado por isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:06.66,0:07:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupa.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não estou preocupado com você, de jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:19.13,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganhei bastante músculo quando emagreci,
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,mas agora que eu engordei de novo, está difícil voar outra vez...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dois blocos de tofu firme, chefe.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro, Dera-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está animado, Dera-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:30.46,0:07:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguns cortes de bacalhau, por favor.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.80,0:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.50,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,E depois eu preciso comprar cebolas, repolho, cenouras, crown daisy...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.68,0:07:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Parece que vamos ter cozido de peixe com legumes hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, An! Espera!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing}Ah, não de novo!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O que eu precisava comprar mesmo?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:47.88,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cebolas, repolho, cenouras e crown daisy.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.65,0:07:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.15,0:07:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Caramba!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui, Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.19,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão bonito!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda de volta, Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.63,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Dera-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá quente! Quente!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,É bom quando é fresco, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.37,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.66,0:08:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:36.15,0:08:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é a mesma de sempre.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A Anko parecia meio pra baixo.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tem razão, ela estava...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.45,0:08:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheguei, Choi-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda de volta!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.57,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa eu ajudar!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:04.53,0:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é o seu deus?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Esta flor é para a mamãe.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso se chama vaso de flor única.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Já voltei!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:16.24,0:09:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vinda de volta...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:19.87,0:09:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, Anko, que tal fazermos arroz com omelete no jantar hoje?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:25.13,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Você disse outro dia que queria comer arroz com omelete, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vamos fazer ensopado hoje à noite?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Podemos fazer isso amanhã.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá tudo bem, podemos comer ensopado.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.55,0:09:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu colega de classe veio buscar o daifuku!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:41.37,0:09:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:44.03,0:09:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.97,0:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquele é o Yuzuki-kun, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:48.66,0:09:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que o papai teve que gritar tão alto?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:52.70,0:09:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{missing}Igualzinho ao mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou levar pra ele.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:57.33,0:10:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,O avô pede que você experimente um pouco do nosso mochi e chá enquanto espera.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigado.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pode ficar com metade, se quiser.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.72,0:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Então eu aceito—
Dialogue: 9,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Na verdade, acho que vou passar dessa vez.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.42,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seu frango fala demais.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sou um frango!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco na caixa por dez, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.55,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, muito obrigado.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há de quê, é um prazer!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:30.49,0:10:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a Anko está fazendo?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:32.52,0:10:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera, vai chamar ela.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:35.23,0:10:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,An! Seu namorado tá aqui!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.11,0:10:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,An! Desce aí e dá um oi!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.79,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera idiota.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez ela esteja dormindo.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem. Diga a ela que eu mandei um oi.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.06,0:10:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.97,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse tal de "ensopado" tá muito bom!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse tal de "ponzu" é azedo!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente pode colocar arroz depois!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado pela comida.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:02.21,0:11:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Já acabou?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:03.47,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Já. Vou dormir.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pegou um resfriado?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.48,0:11:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:25.53,0:11:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizou, preciso te perguntar uma coisa.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:29.21,0:11:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A Anko parece meio pra baixo...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.78,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe se aconteceu algo na escola?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tô meio preocupada...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:37.39,0:11:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensando bem, ela tava estranha no caminho de casa hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.76,0:11:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou perguntar pra ela amanhã—
Dialogue: 9,0:11:50.35,0:11:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou indo.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.93,0:11:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que você tá aqui, Mocchi?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Você chegou mais cedo do que o normal.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tô de serviço hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan ainda está se arrumando.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.24,0:12:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vim aqui por causa da Tamako hoje...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.06,0:12:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:06.99,0:12:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Espera, Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:09.20,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te disse, ela esqueceu do seu aniversário!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,É?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.14,0:12:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enfim, Anko...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:17.82,0:12:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não devia se abater só por causa de uma nota ruim.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:22.34,0:12:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do que você tá falando?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:23.74,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não é isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:25.34,0:12:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, você não devia se abater só porque brigou com uma amiga.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:28.21,0:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não briguei.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua professora ficou brava com você então?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.64,0:12:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tropeçou no corredor?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:34.41,0:12:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Você caiu da escada?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:37.11,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pela última vez, não!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:38.57,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Então o que houve?!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O Yuzuki-kun vai se transferir pra outra escola!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando acabar o primeiro semestre e começar as férias de outono!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No dia 10 de outubro! No Dia do Mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:02.84,0:13:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{Eyecatch 13:03}
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.22,0:13:07.22,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\pos(1031,215)}Tamako Mercado
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.22,0:13:07.22,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.5\blur4\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\3c&H614867&\pos(1030,213)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Mercado
Dialogue: 3,0:13:03.22,0:13:07.22,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HAA78E4&\pos(1029,211)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Mercado
Dialogue: 5,0:13:03.22,0:13:07.22,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(1029,211)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Mercado
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.47,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercado Tamako!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.56,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs40\blur0.9\fnMarker SD\c&H454444&\b1\pos(981.6,612)}10 de outubro é \NDia do Mochi{\b0}
Dialogue: 9,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Que diabos, Gohei?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:16.38,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também vai fazer isso?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:17.44,0:13:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,É o Dia do Mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.29,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou começar antes de você!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.57,0:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cala a boca! Vamos começar antes de {\i1}você{\i0}!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizou, traz o arroz para o mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:26.63,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vou, papai!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{Mamedai}Você não tem o direito de me chamar de pai!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.33,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Gohei}De que lado você acha que está?!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako, o arroz para o mochi já está pronto?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.20,0:13:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo. Vou tirar.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:36.62,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mochizou, você perguntou pra Anko o que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.74,0:13:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.80,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O que ela disse?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:42.83,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma amiga dela vai se mudar hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:44.92,0:13:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, é, a Anko tem muita coisa na cabeça.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:47.76,0:13:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:48.76,0:13:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:52.99,0:13:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko-chan, usa isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,É daikon ralado.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:57.09,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Também temos sopa de missô com porco te esperando na nossa loja.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:59.68,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Viemos ajudar.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, Anko-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kanna-oneesan ensaiou bater mochi só pra hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:10.96,0:14:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bate!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.96,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.78,0:14:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bate!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhul!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Midori-chan, que horas são?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.56,0:14:15.76,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Kanna}Bate!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.81,0:14:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,São quase 4.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:23.92,0:14:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.15,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.05,0:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:27.74,0:14:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:28.26,0:14:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mais um!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.12,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera, fazer mochi é bem parecido com a cerimônia de bênção da terra!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.57,0:14:33.88,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:33.88,0:14:34.80,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.45,0:14:36.78,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.50,0:14:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{Dera}Agora que você falou, parece exatamente com a dança!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:36.78,0:14:37.66,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Tamako}Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:38.70,0:14:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna, o que é aquilo?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma cobra.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:41.22,0:14:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-sama?!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:42.15,0:14:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqueles movimentos de mão chamando as nuvens de chuva e aqueles quadris preparados pra carregar a colheita!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é a Dança da Terra da nossa ilha?!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-sama...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:54.32,0:14:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-sama tá se divertindo!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.59,0:14:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-chan, que fofo!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.40,0:15:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece muito com as poses de bater mochi que você tava fazendo.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza! Agora eu vou bater o mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:04.00,0:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Makino Kanna vai juntar este pilão e o almofariz para o futuro brilhante de todos os mochis.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:09.88,0:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.28,0:15:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bate.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.41,0:15:12.84,Alternative,,0,0,0,,É!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:12.46,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Continuem assim!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.64,0:15:14.89,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kanna-chan é boa nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:14.89,0:15:16.38,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:17.55,0:15:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{Crowd}É!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi, Mocchi?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko, vai se despedir do Yuzuki-kun.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda dá tempo.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:37.41,0:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai embora de carro ao pôr do sol.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.57,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Então é melhor ir agora.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:43.35,0:15:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consigo!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:44.94,0:15:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que eu fosse, não sei o que dizer!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.24,0:15:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Eu te amo"?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:51.69,0:15:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso soa tão bobo.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Se cuida" então?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:54.26,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Qualquer um pode dizer isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.40,0:15:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Então tudo que você pode dizer é "Eu te amo"!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não consigo!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:59.06,0:15:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:02.39,0:16:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,O que tá acontecendo aqui? E a An?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero que a Anko faça um recado pra mim.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.99,0:16:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, Anko.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Você poderia levar isso pro Yuzuki-kun?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.41,0:16:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero que o Yuzuki-kun coma esse mochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.39,0:16:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O Yuzuki-kun vai ficar muito feliz.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.06,0:16:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,É mochi recém-feito.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:25.24,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi fresquinho é o melhor!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.89,0:16:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi recém-feito é gostoso?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:37.61,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai ficar feliz se receber?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:40.37,0:16:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá! Eu vou!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:45.85,0:16:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuida da Anko pra mim.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza, entendi! Deixa ela comigo!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Valeu, Mochizou.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá tudo sujo...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.46,0:17:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,An!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:24.55,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Corre, An!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:25.73,0:17:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vou voar!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,E chegar lá antes de você!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.86,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso não é justo!
