Dialogue: 9,0:17:42.61,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:45.05,0:17:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:47.93,0:17:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum... Ah...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:50.84,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko-chan, machucou os joelhos?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum... Sim...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.92,0:17:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fica aqui. Vou trazer alguns curativos.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:57.47,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera! Para!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.16,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An, faz agora!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:01.67,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:03.75,0:18:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.49,0:18:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:06.24,0:18:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Com licença!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:07.87,0:18:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum... Aqui. Mochi fresquinho.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.11,0:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim! Hoje é o Dia do Mochi, então estávamos amassando mochi na loja!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse mochi é recém-feito!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi recém-feito é uma delícia!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.16,0:18:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem anko por dentro—não eu, o anko (pasta de feijão) por dentro!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.06,0:18:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu caí, então eles podem não estar inteiros...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:31.36,0:18:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Anko-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.09,0:18:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Minha família sempre compra o mochi da Tamaya pro Ano Novo.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos na loja pedir este ano,
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,e eu também passo lá pra buscar.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:43.43,0:18:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente se vê de novo então.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:52.81,0:18:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come à vontade!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:54.56,0:18:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Delícia!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:55.72,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Choi-chan, você tá comendo demais.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:58.19,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, suas bochechas são tão macias e fofinhas!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:00.32,0:19:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa eu tocar agora!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.49,0:19:02.90,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{missing}Esfrega, esfrega, esfrega!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:02.90,0:19:03.98,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{missing}Macias e fofinhas!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:17.79,0:19:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pode até parecer uma coisa bem boba de dizer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.85,0:19:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas eu vou te fazer feliz pro resto da sua vida.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.83,0:19:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eu te amo tanto,{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.61,0:19:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tanto que eu não aguento.{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.50,0:19:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas—{\i0}
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.94,0:19:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pai, essa música!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.12,0:19:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem comigo!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.34,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.96,0:19:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,O que está acontecendo?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pra onde você vai?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.09,0:19:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, espera um segundo!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Só vem!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:52.48,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O que tá acontecendo?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não sei, mas você vem também!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.49,0:19:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, essa era a música?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.66,0:20:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A melodia é meio diferente do que você tava cantando.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:03.85,0:20:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela é desafinada, tá?!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.05,0:20:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:07.61,0:20:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa música...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:08.85,0:20:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O Dai escreveu essa música pra Hinako-san.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pra mamãe?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:14.94,0:20:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,O papai escreveu?!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.68,0:20:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunio-san! Não precisava contar isso pra ela!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:19.73,0:20:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando éramos mais jovens, tocávamos numa banda juntos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:29.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}yuuhi ga shizumu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:29.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}O sol começa a se pôr
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}ongaku shitsu de
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:32.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Na sala de música
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}piano kanade
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:35.38,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Ao olhar lá dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.28,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}anata no
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.28,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Você está lá
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:39.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}yawarakai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:39.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Você está tocando piano
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}yokogao mi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}E eu vejo sua sombra
Dialogue: 9,0:20:44.55,0:20:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,É o papai...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.80,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}ki ga tsukeba anata kara
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.80,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Antes que eu percebesse
Dialogue: 9,0:20:47.03,0:20:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,É o papai?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:51.68,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}me ga hanasanakute
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:51.68,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Eu não conseguia tirar os olhos de você
Dialogue: 9,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,E essa era aquela música?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,É completamente diferente.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}anata no ie no
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}So I got your
Dialogue: 9,0:20:53.30,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma canção de amor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}número de telefone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Número de telefone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}kurikaeshi kaite
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Escrevê-lo várias vezes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}oboete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:02.94,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Pra eu lembrar
Dialogue: 9,0:21:03.27,0:21:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê? Aconteceu algo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}jushinki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.45,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Eu atendo o telefone
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles eram tão legais!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.14,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}te ni shite
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:09.14,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Segura meu dedo
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.45,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanto o Master quanto o pai da Tamako!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O papai também amou alguém uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:14.36,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}dial wo mawasu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:14.36,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Eu giro o disco
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.36,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,E essa alguém era nossa mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:17.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}sore dake nan da
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:17.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Isso é tudo que eu precisava fazer
Dialogue: 9,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:23.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}nakeba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:23.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Aí toca
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:29.14,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}sonna yuuki mo dasenai kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:29.14,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Mas eu não tenho coragem de ir até o fim
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:36.19,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}sore de
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:36.19,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Por isso
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:42.11,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}kono uta wo anata no tame dake ni utau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:42.11,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Estou cantando esta música só pra você
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:02.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}sugoku bakageta koto nan dakedo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:22:02.16,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Pode até parecer uma coisa bem boba de dizer
Dialogue: 9,0:21:56.99,0:21:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigado de novo por hoje, Mocchi.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:59.18,0:22:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem problema. Até amanhã.
Dialogue: 9,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mochizou, espera um segundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:06.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}anata wo isshou shiawase ni suru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:06.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Mas eu vou te fazer feliz pelo resto da sua vida
Dialogue: 9,0:22:05.17,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizou...
Dialogue: 9,0:22:06.50,0:22:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Feliz aniversário!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:12.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}anata ga daisuki de
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:12.96,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}Eu te amo tanto
